            "sid": "2CH 18:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kïlö pöytoghintö Israel, “Anama Mikaya ayoda kïwö wölo mi Amon, wowïn pö kanasyan nko wölo mi Yoas wero pöytoghin. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.18.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.18.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 18:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Atolapay olenchï, ‘Kölö pöytoghintö okörchinö chichï chela, apagha omisyö nyo le kite nko pögh tïkwïte tökïtenö amïlan ompö kalya.’ ”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.18.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.18.26"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 18:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.18.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.18.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 18:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kïlenchï Mikaya, “Ato töp temïlenyi ompö kalya kïmelö kingölonwanïn ECHOTYON.” Atolapay kïlö, “Akwa löwïr, atera ngalechan!”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.18.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.18.27"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Megha Aap",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 18:27"
          },
          "items": [
